---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Councils and Districts
eyebrow: Districts 94–114
intro: Explore 74 confirmed council assignments across the Chapter’s 21 districts.
headerTheme: councils
permalink: /councils/
councilMap: true
---
<div class="roster-notice"><strong>The Chapter serves 81 councils.</strong> This directory currently lists 74 confirmed assignments; additional councils will be added as information is confirmed.</div>
<div class="district-controls"><label for="district-filter">Choose a district</label><select id="district-filter" data-district-select><option value="all">All districts</option>{% for district in districts %}<option value="{{ district.number }}">District {{ district.number }}</option>{% endfor %}</select></div>
<div class="map-layout">
  <div class="map-wrap"><div id="council-map" class="map" role="region" aria-label="Map of currently verified Southern California Chapter council locations" aria-describedby="map-help map-status"></div><p id="map-status" class="map-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="map-help" class="map-note">The map is supplementary. Use the keyboard-accessible district directory and Google Maps links for the same council information. Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors. Markers show approximate city or ZIP locations, not verified meeting addresses. Councils without confirmed coordinates remain available in the directory.</p></div>
  <div class="district-list" aria-live="polite">{% for district in districts %}<details class="district-group" data-district-group data-district="{{ district.number }}"><summary><span><strong>District {{ district.number }}</strong><small>{{ district.councils | length }} listed councils</small></span><span class="district-deputy"><small>District Deputy</small>{{ district.deputy }}</span></summary><div class="district-councils">{% for council in district.councils %}<article class="council-card" data-council-card data-district="{{ district.number }}"><p>Council {{ council.councilNumber }}</p><h2>{{ council.name or "Council name forthcoming" }}</h2><p>{{ council.city }}{% if council.zipCode %}, CA {{ council.zipCode }}{% else %}, California{% endif %}</p>{% if council.officialRecordVerified == false %}<p class="verification-note">Official council record pending verification.</p>{% endif %}<a href="{{ council | mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Navigate with Google Maps →</a></article>{% endfor %}</div></details>{% endfor %}</div>
</div>
<script id="district-data" type="application/json">{{ districts | dump | safe }}</script>
